Conclusion  : Neutral, marginally below best. lr_auprc 0.5230 vs best 0.5283 (-1.0%), inside the hypothesised 0.52-0.55 band and within noise. No collapse: the run is non-degenerate and both health gates passed. Secondary metrics are healthy (lr_auroc 0.828, direction_accuracy 0.766). It trained on the full formal data (portion 1.0), so data volume does not explain the gap. No baseline score is available.
