Memory Update: Treat 0.523 (hidden_dim 64, 30 ep) and 0.528 (hidden_dim 32, 40 ep) as equivalent within noise at lr 3e-3 with smooth_l1. Do not spend more rounds on width or epochs in this region. Validation plateaus around epoch 13-20, so 20-30 epochs is enough. The hidden_dim 32 model is the better candidate for Solidification because it has fewer parameters and the best score. For a real gain, change something structural. Options: loss_type (e.g. a ranking or contact-aware loss, which is not comparable on loss value), lr schedule or lr (1e-3 or cosine decay, since val is noisy at 3e-3), dropout or weight_decay for the train-val gap, num_layers, or the feature flags (rank_stats, weighted_corr, residualize, min_contacts, ridge_lambda). Formal data scope is operator-fixed at 1.0, so do not recommend changing trial_portion. Confirm any apparent improvement with a repeat seed, because differences under about 1-2% here are not distinguishable from noise.
